# 12. Where gradient descent fits

Gradient descent is actually the least philosophically interesting part.

It is primarily the **optimization engine**.

For example:

```text
                     OBJECTIVE
                         │
             ┌───────────┴───────────┐
             │                       │
        language objective     semantic objective
             │                       │
             └───────────┬───────────┘
                         │
